<template><AppShell title="实名认证" back><view class="pad"><StateView :loading="loading" :error="error" :count="ready?1:0" @retry="refresh" /><template v-if="ready&&!loading&&!error"><view class="card"><view class="row between"><text class="title">真实身份核验</text><text :class="['tag',{green:verified}]">{{verified?'已实名':'未实名'}}</text></view><text class="intro">实名认证用于核实身份。姓名和证件信息不在公开主页展示。</text><view class="requirements"><text>发布求购：实名认证</text><text>出售道具：实名认证 + 店铺认证</text></view><text v-if="verified" class="intro">已取得实名核验渠道返回的通过结果。</text><text v-else class="field-error">{{config.realnameReady?'实名认证通道正在准备中，暂不能发起核验，请稍后重试。':'实名认证服务尚未开通，暂不能完成核验。'}}</text><button class="ui-button btn outline wide section" @click="refresh">刷新实名状态</button><button v-if="verified" class="ui-button btn wide section" @click="go('publish/index')">发布求购</button><button class="ui-button text-button wide section" @click="go('certification/index')">{{session.user?.playerProfile?.shopStatus==='APPROVED'?'查看店铺认证':'我要出售，去店铺认证'}} ›</button></view><view class="card"><text class="field-label">认证说明</text><text class="intro">手机号验证确认号码归属；店铺审核核查提交的经营资料。两者均不能替代真实身份核验，会员与成长等级也不替代认证。</text></view></template></view></AppShell></template>
<script setup>
import {ref,computed,watch} from 'vue';import {onShow} from '@dcloudio/uni-app';import AppShell from '../../components/AppShell.vue';import StateView from '../../components/StateView.vue';import {session,loadMe,loadConfig,requireLogin,go} from '../../lib/api'
const loading=ref(false),error=ref(''),ready=ref(false),config=ref({}),verified=computed(()=>session.user?.playerProfile?.realnameStatus==='VERIFIED');let version=0
watch(()=>session.token,()=>{version++;ready.value=false;loading.value=false;error.value=''},{flush:'sync'});onShow(()=>{if(requireLogin())refresh()})
async function refresh(){if(loading.value)return;const token=session.token,v=++version;loading.value=true;error.value='';try{await loadMe();const c=await loadConfig();if(token===session.token&&v===version){config.value=c;ready.value=true}}catch(e){if(v===version)error.value=e.message}finally{if(v===version)loading.value=false}}
</script>
<style scoped>.intro{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin-top:18px;color:#666b78}.requirements{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;background:#fff8cf;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:18px 0;font-size:14px}</style>
